/T (    When people agree to small requests first, they become more likely to accept much larger requests later. Each step seems only slightly bigger than the previous one, making dramatic change almost invisible while it happens. It feels like adding a single particle of salt to water, it's unnoticeable until it's too much. Looking back, outsiders may see a huge transformation. Living through it, members often experience only small changes that alter the course of their lives.)
