960 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 411 0 R
/E (Perhaps the greatest lesson from the visit was not about any particular disorder at all. It was about human possibility. The man who began using substances at fourteen eventually became someone who helps others recover. That single transformation is a reminder that people are not frozen at their lowest point. With support, treatment, time and sometimes extraordinary resilience, lives can change in directions that once seemed impossible. The person sitting in a rehabilitation centre today may not be the same person they become years from now, just as the man who now works there could not have known at fourteen what his future would eventually look like. His story does not erase the years of addiction, )
/Pg 65 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
