/T (A gratitude journal is a personal diary where one writes what they are grateful for in life. It is one of the easiest habits anyone can start with; it helps one get distracted about what is happening in their lives. Unlike the regular diary where you write everything that happened in a day, the gratitude journal is about being appreciative of life's ups and downs. )
