/T (\(Surprise, surprise!\) Cristiano Ronaldo offers one of the clearest examples of how an athlete can become psychologically larger than their sport. His appeal is not based solely on his footballing ability, because athletic excellence alone cannot explain an Instagram following approaching 680 million. Ronaldo has constructed a public identity around discipline, ambition, physical transformation, competitiveness and an almost theatrical refusal to accept decline.)
