/Title (Ronaldo's enormous audience therefore makes sense when viewed not simply as a measure of popularity but as a measure of identification. People do not only admire what he can do; they admire what they believe he represents. To one person, he represents discipline; to another, confidence; to another, competitiveness; to another, the fantasy of transforming oneself completely. The footballer becomes a psychological symbol.)
